#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:5 56183e6a95ba4883851b19337a761ab2
#: dd9b948655bd4942b9f0e5663a0b008b
msgid "Internal Combustion Engines (ICE)"
msgstr "内燃机（ICE）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:6 1808141d70274713949d7bfa5cd1198b
#: b6aaa12e8a3d4d7297931609448ef87f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot can manage ignition, starter, and throttle for internal combustion"
" engines (ICE) in planes and quadplanes. It allows engines to be started and"
" stopped (manually, or automatically in a mission), and optional min/max RPM"
" governors. It can also be configured to allow the throttle to be controlled"
" in Manual mode while disarmed, which is useful for ground testing and "
"preflight run-up for quadplanes without needing to arm the vehicle (which "
"risks a failsafe turning on the VTOL motors)."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 可以管理飞机和四旋翼飞机中内燃机（ICE）的点火、启动和油门。它允许发动机启动和停止（手动或自动执行任务），以及可选的最小/最大 "
"RPM 调速器。它还可以配置为允许在手动模式下解锁状态下控制油门，这对于四旋翼飞机的地面测试和飞前热机非常有用，无需解锁飞行器（这会有失控保护开启 "
"VTOL 电机的风险）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:9 36b666e282e8497ab20ab61df24637a2
#: 37744c6a90f04b53b40e297bb6ec8c0b
msgid "What to Buy"
msgstr "购买什么"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:11 409fb1e2e14f4ba6b19fd6a344204dbd
#: 60e51feedbe947cbb65428f3eb163df4
msgid ""
"The only required hardware is an engine (gas, glow, etc.) and a servo to "
"control the throttle."
msgstr "唯一需要的硬件是一台发动机（汽油、辉光等）和一个控制油门的舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:13 1bc28639c13c4a618ec9328c162ed78d
#: 637c55e70eef42ec987658db0ed2f94c
msgid "Optional:"
msgstr "可选："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:15 107ec06cb38c462593b45a467e38105d
#: 20b211a9a7fa4e8b83859b904f0b1c59
msgid ""
"An RPM sensor. This can be a simple hall-effect sensor connected to a GPIO "
"pin, or an ignition module with a tach output. This is needed for the RPM "
"governors and the auto-restart feature if using an onboard starter."
msgstr ""
"RPM 传感器。可以是连接到 GPIO 引脚的简单霍尔效应传感器，或带有转速计输出的点火模块。如果使用板载启动器，这是 RPM "
"调速器和自动重启功能所必需的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:16 8056337dd5544788ba2b934f503d13d0
#: ad1d7c5fbeb845ff90ee2f272b1883d2
msgid ""
"Ignition module and an RC Switch for controlling power to it like `this one "
"from milehighrc.com <http://milehighrc.com/switch.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"点火模块和 RC 开关，用于控制对其的供电，如 `milehighrc.com 的这款 "
"<http://milehighrc.com/switch.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:17 4faa0b96bb0948ed98bbcbb3672a4cad
#: c393d1612f4c4adfb1fc65baeb7d0e49
msgid ""
"An electric starter like `this one from milehighrc.com "
"<http://milehighrc.com/EME_E_Start.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"电动启动器，如 `milehighrc.com 的这款 <http://milehighrc.com/EME_E_Start.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:20 0c116590e5da4096b26c2826b0345474
#: 702df6de8d174ec0992645c1ecd046fa
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:22 b40f00a95b7e49e797cb8e67397059d4
#: b510abd3e5d64f219b02c010fda5884e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`ICE_ENABLE <ICE_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the ICE feature (you may "
"need to reload parameters after setting this in order to see below "
"parameters)."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`ICE_ENABLE <ICE_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用 ICE 功能（设置后可能需要重新加载参数以查看以下参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:25 77996fe35bd64c7c9f99800144d79ae8
#: f8b3c560a3fe473bb88f4140b213a071
msgid "Throttle Servo"
msgstr "油门舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:26 8da7c44fca9145d7b5de0c6e5ab0aff3
#: e90be5fd552745fc8e640289f3d0c219
msgid ""
"Throttle control for an IC engine is similar to controlling a standard "
"brushless ESC. The throttle servo can be connected to any servo output with "
"a :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION<SERVO3_FUNCTION>` set to 70 (Channel 3 is configured"
" this way by default). It is important to set the Min and Max PWM values on "
"this servo output to be within the mechanical limits of your throttle "
"assembly (using :ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>` and "
":ref:`SERVOx_MAX<SERVO3_MAX>`). While doing this, also verify that the servo"
" moves in the correct direction with respect to manual throttle input."
msgstr ""
"ICE 的油门控制类似于控制标准无刷 ESC。油门舵机可以连接到任何 :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION<SERVO3_FUNCTION>` "
"设置为 70 的舵机输出（默认情况下通道 3 如此配置）。重要的是将此舵机输出上的最小和最大 PWM 值设置在油门组件机械限位内（使用 "
":ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>` 和 "
":ref:`SERVOx_MAX<SERVO3_MAX>`）。同时验证舵机随手动油门输入的运动方向是否正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:28 61d9145b17ed4f6a826a6196cf1a26c9
#: e645321164b340959d1a51b39377c488
msgid ""
"Note that, by default, the throttle servo will not move unless the vehicle "
"is"
msgstr "请注意，默认情况下，油门舵机不会移动，除非飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:30 2fdd62af541e48e2bf9d9e36c58b5827
#: d7f57276d0c9437ab66227d28fd1eb78
msgid "Armed, and"
msgstr "已解锁，并且"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:31 5432d307f9214a4fbda6074b7651a09b
#: de00530c584c45f9874e7d05a00dba82
msgid ""
"The engine is considered \"running\" (start command received and RPM above "
"threshold, or no RPM sensor configured)."
msgstr "发动机被认为处于「运行」状态（已收到启动命令且 RPM 高于阈值，或未配置 RPM 传感器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:33 5838b8c025594e78af541ddccffeb3c9
#: a3ca3ccd106e484d9fda03ebacf60e50
msgid ""
"To test your throttle servo limits safely, you can set "
":ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 2 (Value +4) to allow throttle control "
"while disarmed in Manual mode, and it does not require the engine to be "
"considered \"running\". If you do not want this option long-term, be sure to"
" disable it after testing."
msgstr ""
"为了安全地测试油门舵机限位，可以设置 :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 2 位（值 "
"+4），允许在手动模式下解锁状态下控制油门，且不要求发动机处于「运行」状态。如果不想长期使用此选项，测试后请务必禁用它。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:35 42e9924d745f46f5852afbf91b560f4c
#: e78d7362fe354f4f874308d9b943cd6c
msgid ""
"For setting :ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>`, you can either set it to the PWM "
"value that corresponds to idle throttle, or set it to the PWM value that "
"corresponds to fully closed throttle, allowing you to cut the engine even if"
" you do not have and ignition switch. If you set it to the fully closed "
"throttle, be sure to set :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` to an appropriate"
" value so that the engine does not stall after starting."
msgstr ""
"对于设置 :ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO3_MIN>`，可以将其设置为对应怠速油门的 PWM 值，或设置为对应完全关闭油门的 PWM "
"值，即使没有点火开关也允许切断发动机。如果将其设置为完全关闭油门，请确保将 :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` "
"设置为适当的值，以使发动机启动后不熄火。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:37 68d0eb6842504ef1afc965328ebde1e9
#: c6924be1f52144db8c4a9ffa2a29a22d
msgid ""
"If you set :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` to a value greater than zero, "
"the engine will be allowed to start while disarmed. If you do not want this,"
" set :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 3 (value +8) to prevent starting "
"while disarmed. See `Controlling the Engine`_ below for more information."
msgstr ""
"如果将 :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` 设置为大于零的值，则允许在解锁状态下启动发动机。如果不希望这样，请设置 "
":ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 3 位（值 +8）以防止在解锁状态下启动。更多信息见下方「控制发动机」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:39 0334389421294229be6ab59e8ce9c10b
#: 140a2e0429f84aa6970d44a4ac9b50c0
msgid ""
"After configuring the limits of your throttle servo, the following "
"parameters must be set:"
msgstr "配置油门舵机限位后，必须设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:41 a70ada5a5a0c4fd292af4c463ef340cc
#: d25c15e6a9764435a52264621e76b8cb
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>` to the desired setting at idle. This will be "
"found empirically during engine testing."
msgstr "将 :ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>` 设置为怠速时的所需设置。此值将在发动机测试期间通过实验确定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:42 ab478dc0493347e4acef5b1e3b802cc6
#: c4e33eb2ec4f48df9fa03c62849f80ce
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`THR_SLEWRATE <THR_SLEWRATE>` to a value appropriate for your "
"engine. 20%/s is a good starting point."
msgstr "将 :ref:`THR_SLEWRATE <THR_SLEWRATE>` 设置为适合你发动机的值。20%/s 是一个好的起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:43 166c3f17d64c463bbba343131901379b
#: 83223dc668984dd3adaaefcc4d3a295e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`THR_MAX <THR_MAX>` if you would like to prevent your engine from "
"reaching full throttle."
msgstr "如果希望防止发动机达到全油门，请设置 :ref:`THR_MAX <THR_MAX>`。"

