"The engine is also automatically stopped or started in some situations:"
msgstr "在某些情况下，发动机也会自动停止或启动："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:71 3520219a4c1642a2a76ccbaf9cd1785a
#: d3b784538f3e4b9084bef767add542d1
msgid ""
"In auto missions, the engine can be started and stopped using the "
":ref:`DO_ENGINE_CONTROL<mav_cmd_do_engine_control>` mission command."
msgstr ""
"在自动任务中，可以使用 :ref:`DO_ENGINE_CONTROL<mav_cmd_do_engine_control>` "
"任务命令启动和停止发动机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:72 15c1bbccbed14a5790b652e48c5ec758
#: fec21f3ea43a4af1bc3720aa99821eed
msgid ""
"On quadplanes, the engine will be automatically disabled during the final "
"stage of a VTOL landing if :ref:`Q_LAND_ICE_CUT<Q_LAND_ICE_CUT>` is set to "
"1. This is useful to reduce dust ingestion and the risk of prop strikes "
"while landing."
msgstr ""
"在四旋翼飞机上，如果 :ref:`Q_LAND_ICE_CUT<Q_LAND_ICE_CUT>` 设置为 1，则在 VTOL "
"降落的最后阶段发动机将自动禁用。这有助于减少降落时的扬尘吸入和螺旋桨撞击风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:73 ceb900269b774f67b0ecfb886dbd6640
#: fc8f7e56245d42a2aea32db9c6bf793e
msgid ""
"If :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 0 is set (value +1), the engine will "
"automatically disable during RC failsafe."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位被设置（值 +1），发动机将在 RC 失控保护期间自动禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:74 7ef6afb2bfcd44a5be8af19946a0faee
#: caaf976ed0e74f9682bd9dcece1c3858
msgid ""
"The engine will automatically disable during an emergency stop AUX function,"
" if configured. See :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`."
msgstr "如果配置了紧急停止辅助功能，发动机将在执行紧急停止时自动禁用。见 :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:75 7d6aad6a4dd44b28840bd79012d72eb4
#: a122ef9002314031ab61aab3b92afa10
msgid ""
"The engine will automatically disable during parachute deployment, if used. "
"See :ref:`common-parachute`."
msgstr "如果使用降落伞，发动机将在降落伞部署时自动禁用。见 :ref:`common-parachute`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:77 99ab8ef7785a4ec29c84de83c6a779f9
#: db4de56f690c4a6d9495fc79454e02d0
msgid ""
"By default, the engine cannot be started while disarmed. If you want to "
"allow it to start while disarmed, either set "
":ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` to a value greater than zero, or set "
":ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 2 (value +4) to allow throttle control "
"while disarmed in Manual mode."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，在解锁状态下无法启动发动机。如果想允许在解锁状态下启动，可以将 :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` "
"设置为大于零的值，或设置 :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 2 位（值 +4）以允许在手动模式下解锁状态下控制油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:79 2b9169d4b8ec49488c421e8dfe43fb3c
#: 6a06464eb6854a058b7e04e8c16f9869
msgid ""
"If you would like to use :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>`, but *don't* want"
" to allow starting while disarmed, set :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 3"
" (value +8)."
msgstr ""
"如果想使用 :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` 但 *不* 希望在解锁状态下启动，请设置 "
":ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 3 位（值 +8）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:82 081a692fc00342a99ad3c390f9235243
#: 1d6b4ce6faf84da993ab473d065fcb26
msgid ""
"Even with :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 3 set, the engine can still be"
" started while disarmed with a "
":ref:`DO_ENGINE_CONTROL<mav_cmd_do_engine_control>` command if param4 is set"
" to 1, though in this case it will only start once and won't attempt to "
"restart if it stalls while still disarmed."
msgstr ""
"即使设置了 :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 3 位，如果 param4 设置为 1，发动机仍然可以通过 "
":ref:`DO_ENGINE_CONTROL<mav_cmd_do_engine_control>` "
"命令在解锁状态下启动，但在这种情况下，它只会启动一次，并且在仍处于解锁状态时如果熄火不会尝试重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:85 6bcaf924f274448c943bb7c0ae8e9731
#: 7e96ccfebc2745d79bb087e5655927ac
msgid "Ignition and Starter Outputs"
msgstr "点火和启动器输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:87 0bce2dda44234259a17ca0f212d0d952
#: 8815cf23f6f44e54ba38f34f567c3a43
msgid ""
"The optional ignition power switch and starter outputs can be each be "
"controlled using a servo output (connected to a PWM switch) or a GPIO pin "
"(connected to a relay, or to the enable pin of an engine control unit). See "
":ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping` and :ref:`common-relay` for information on "
"how to configure servo outputs as relays for ignition and starter control."
msgstr ""
"可选的点火电源开关和启动器输出可以分别使用舵机输出（连接到 PWM 开关）或 GPIO "
"引脚（连接到继电器，或发动机控制单元的使能引脚）来控制。有关如何将舵机输出配置为继电器用于点火和启动器控制的信息，请参阅 :ref:`common-"
"rcoutput-mapping` 和 :ref:`common-relay`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:89 0c230c35ff444b36942b0012b874e11f
#: 7d84f744ebe54500bc87a27ae8881d7a
msgid "If using PWM outputs,"
msgstr "如果使用 PWM 输出，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:120 ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:92
#: 3e794f4130104938b244b19309e1b81a 4441df4838334fb68f61586dc9af654e
#: 97d35569c4d24c3daab3f37402e13882 aa2024f75c6443b7b791f83cdd2be005
msgid "ArduPilot 4.6 and later"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.6 及更高版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:94 13412b2d7a054130b471ec7f4a9207f6
#: 4c799ed9a0ed4de18e73aa72bb48a155
msgid ""
"the PWM value sent to the ignition power switch when the engine should be "
"running or stopped is set by the  :ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO10_MIN>` and "
":ref:`SERVOx_MAX<SERVO10_MIN>` value of the output used for the `Ignition` "
"function."
msgstr ""
"发动机运行或停止时发送到点火电源开关的 PWM 值，由用于「点火」功能的输出的 :ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO10_MIN>` 和 "
":ref:`SERVOx_MAX<SERVO10_MIN>` 值设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:95 0bfa6a1dc4ae4d03b5125568e30b8eba
#: e5c2e2fcb2c048d6907ce510087550ed
msgid ""
"the PWM value sent to the starter switch when it should be cranking is set "
"by the :ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO10_MIN>` and :ref:`SERVOx_MAX<SERVO10_MIN>` "
"value of the output used for the `Starter` function."
msgstr ""
"启动器曲轴旋转时发送到启动器开关的 PWM 值，由用于「启动器」功能的输出的 :ref:`SERVOx_MIN<SERVO10_MIN>` 和 "
":ref:`SERVOx_MAX<SERVO10_MIN>` 值设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:124 ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:97
#: 3b170c22d7024cf2a56105518edacaed 9f6f7261d87f48ef8e6a4923811530a2
#: da44b99eb723437b977482f3f0aa0b43 f31f95d92ee445149f0a485a99bee75f
msgid "ArduPilot prior to 4.6"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.6 之前版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:99 2f1fc8cb5bbc4bf0a03bef1f12aaa2b7
#: 89ddbb56d06e42968d5db378f9d52421
msgid ""
"``ICE_PWM_STRT_ON`` is the PWM value sent to the starter to start the engine"
msgstr "``ICE_PWM_STRT_ON`` 是发送到启动器以启动发动机的 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:100 80aee92e48984eada4465e771a024b0a
#: d7f3862837934685a2a8b9f4001fbd73
msgid ""
"``ICE_PWM_STRT_OFF`` is the PWM value sent to the starter when not trying to"
" start the engine"
msgstr "``ICE_PWM_STRT_OFF`` 是未尝试启动发动机时发送到启动器的 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:101 263e0409bed743089f72c1096bc6720d
#: 4b953d97f4a3450886f3ee9111895eae
msgid ""
"``ICE_PWM_IGN_ON`` is the PWM value sent to the ignition power switch when "
"the engine should be running"
msgstr "``ICE_PWM_IGN_ON`` 是发动机应运行时发送到点火电源开关的 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:102 1c460d2e9c17488083cc1bbb0effd197
#: c536171c8801423aa44b0f78f81ee468
msgid ""
"``ICE_PWM_IGN_OFF`` is the PWM value sent to the ignition power switch when "
"the engine should be stopped"
msgstr "``ICE_PWM_IGN_OFF`` 是发动机应停止时发送到点火电源开关的 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:105 637e0582580a4e6badef36c3522e93c3
#: b27adb206e14422b9b0cef15922555d3
msgid "RC Switch Setup"
msgstr "RC 开关设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:107 35314c0221f845588e201d443e753f1e
#: d554cad7de7a497e9e336771ddf15d9c
msgid ""
"It is common to use a 3 position switch on an RC transmitter is used to "
"control the engine. This switch has the following three positions:"
msgstr "通常使用 RC 遥控器上的三档开关来控制发动机。此开关具有以下三个位置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:109 72e4ef3bce2c48ca9c052e959a084687
#: 7406c85604434aecaf57cec026613585
msgid ""
"Low: Force the engine to be disabled. This ignores MAVLink commands and "
"mission items that attempt to control the engine's state."
msgstr "低：强制禁用发动机。这会忽略试图控制发动机状态的 MAVLink 命令和任务项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:110 b61a26785c094952866db2f2bba43cec
#: e6e33794f89a4cad9d3ca342b2a577a4
msgid ""
"Mid: Keep the current state of the engine, but allow MAVLink commands and "
"mission items to change the state of the engine."
msgstr "中：保持发动机的当前状态，但允许 MAVLink 命令和任务项更改发动机状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:111 22c9b639994d4c069b31b0012531db65
#: 2fda41142b6841919ed865dbe272c2c3
msgid ""
"High: Force the engine to be enabled. This ignores MAVLink commands and "
"mission items that attempt to control the engine's state."
msgstr "高：强制启用发动机。这会忽略试图控制发动机状态的 MAVLink 命令和任务项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:113 3700aa7eabb84a44bc0cf35576abb8ea
#: 7b87e5c550244a969ce5c1a156efaabd
msgid ""
"To start the engine, raise the switch to the high position. If you want the "
"automatic engine-cut features to work, be sure to lower the switch to the "
"middle position after the engine has started."
msgstr "要启动发动机，将开关拨到高位置。如果想让自动熄火功能正常工作，请在发动机启动后将开关降至中间位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:115 4cd85213e72a4a1285d47f4c27afb9ad
#: 8453e64e38e743078f8a31c8d807face
msgid ""
"To stop the engine, lower the switch to the low position. If you want the "
"engine to be automatically start with a mission, or want to use a MAVLink "
"command to start the engine, be sure to raise the switch to the middle "
"position after the engine has stopped."
msgstr ""
"要停止发动机，将开关拨到低位置。如果想让发动机随任务自动启动，或想使用 MAVLink 命令启动发动机，请在发动机停止后将开关升至中间位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:117 22d27435278f4ef3afd2f8444382ef6b
#: d810a13ca60d42a1b07aa5c32cd844f3
msgid "To configure the RC switch,"
msgstr "要配置 RC 开关，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:122 2d523aa5e53f49da8157613379ffee81
#: 48fcc4e0231f4b03a4f458e3a41535dd
msgid ""
"Set an RC auxiliary switch (:ref:`RCx_OPTION<RC6_OPTION>` = 179) be used to "
"start the engine. This channel can start the engine or stop the engine via "
"the ``Ignition`` and ``Starter`` motor/servo outputs (see :ref:`common-"
"rcoutput-mapping`). Normally, the \"kill\" PWM value is anything below "
"1300us, but this can be changed using the "
":ref:`ICE_STARTCHN_MIN<ICE_STARTCHN_MIN>` parameter. Setting up this channel"
" and its RC control is required for operation in order to provide a \"kill\""
" function on the throttle, even if there is no ignition or starter control."
msgstr ""
"设置一个 RC 辅助开关（:ref:`RCx_OPTION<RC6_OPTION>` = 179）用于启动发动机。此通道可以通过 "
"``Ignition`` 和 ``Starter`` 电机/舵机输出来启动或停止发动机（见 :ref:`common-rcoutput-"
"mapping`）。通常，「停机」PWM 值是低于 1300us 的任何值，但可以使用 "
":ref:`ICE_STARTCHN_MIN<ICE_STARTCHN_MIN>` 参数更改。即使没有点火或启动器控制，设置此通道及其 RC "
"控制也是运行所必需的，以提供油门上的「停机」功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:126 3ee6b0b8695b46edb43da8090e13f4ac
#: 4f75fc8a824e411bb8a96db0f2bb800e
msgid ""
"Set ``ICE_START_CHAN`` to the channel number corresponding to a switch on "
"the transmitter which will be used to start the engine. This channel can "
"start the engine or stop the engine via the ``Ignition`` and ``Starter`` "
"outputs. Normally, the \"kill\" PWM value is anything below 1300us, but this"
" can be changed using the :ref:`ICE_STARTCHN_MIN<ICE_STARTCHN_MIN>` "
"parameter. Setting up this channel and its RC control is required for "
"operation in order to provide a \"kill\" function on the throttle, even if "
"there is no ignition or starter control."
msgstr ""
"将 ``ICE_START_CHAN`` 设置为遥控器上对应于将用于启动发动机的开关的通道编号。此通道可以通过 ``Ignition`` 和 "
"``Starter`` 输出来启动或停止发动机。通常，「停机」PWM 值是低于 1300us 的任何值，但可以使用 "
":ref:`ICE_STARTCHN_MIN<ICE_STARTCHN_MIN>` 参数更改。即使没有点火或启动器控制，设置此通道及其 RC "
"控制也是运行所必需的，以提供油门上的「停机」功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:128 0824afbb84f84e419272c6901edca5a7
#: d34deacdd8cf496099e14dd58c8df86c
msgid "These parameters may also need to be adjusted:"
msgstr "这些参数可能也需要调整："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:130 0abc40a1f7a44a1d86b91361f5ecca10
#: 6ea587109e004cc6b9e40064c18146fc
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_STARTCHN_MIN<ICE_STARTCHN_MIN>` is the minimum PWM below which the"
" start channel input will be ignored. This is a safety feature to prevent "
"bad RC input from stopping the motor while the aircraft is beyond line of "
"sight, if the RC protocol is incorrectly configured. Default is zero, "
"meaning disabled."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ICE_STARTCHN_MIN<ICE_STARTCHN_MIN>` 是启动通道输入将被忽略的最低 PWM "
"值。这是一个安全功能，防止错误的 RC 输入在飞行器超出视线范围时停止电机（如果 RC 协议配置不正确）。默认为零，表示禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:133 45e55deff0f248efac203afdff0cd12d
#: 89d8514976b643819e76d3e36890d423
msgid "Starting with an Onboard Starter"
msgstr "使用板载启动器启动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:134 21de63899adb480298e53d7cb6704b24
#: cb2bd9d14c664f46bf4fca7d6458c6b0
msgid ""
"If using an onboard starter, it is strongly recommended to configure an RPM "
"sensor for the engine, since the primary benefit of an onboard starter is to"
" automatically attempt to restart the engine if it fails in flight. See `RPM"
" Configuration`_ below for more information."
msgstr ""
"如果使用板载启动器，强烈建议为发动机配置 RPM 传感器，因为板载启动器的主要好处是在飞行中发动机失效时自动尝试重新启动。更多信息见下方「RPM "
"配置」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:136 713d0930feaa4145aba0406999dea45c
#: d277637595f142aa9176abaa066eba09
msgid ""
"The auto-start functionality will attempt to start the engine any time the "
"vehicle is armed, the engine is enabled, and the measured RPM is below the "
":ref:`ICE_RPM_THRESH <ICE_RPM_THRESH>`. If the engine is not successfully "
"started within a configurable amount of time, the program will wait for a "
"configurable delay before attempting to start again. It is important to "
"remember that the starter will run in pulses. DO NOT approach the engine "
"between failed start attempts as the starter will attempt to start again if "
"the engine is still enabled."
msgstr ""
"自动启动功能将在飞行器解锁、发动机启用且测量到的 RPM 低于 :ref:`ICE_RPM_THRESH <ICE_RPM_THRESH>` "
"时随时尝试启动发动机。如果在可配置的时间内未能成功启动发动机，程序将等待可配置的延迟后再尝试启动。重要的是记住启动器将以脉冲方式运行。在失败的启动尝试之间不要靠近发动机，因为如果发动机仍然处于启用状态，启动器将再次尝试启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:138 5fe3d3b30ffd4c2c9b66a89d31f60d7a
#: 73a03af9dc1a4613a61eda5272b71723
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_START_PCT <ICE_START_PCT>` overrides the throttle setting during "
"start."
msgstr ":ref:`ICE_START_PCT <ICE_START_PCT>` 在启动期间覆盖油门设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:139 25ba62fbb665417094c0fa990493efa9
#: a99b7c2dfa004c8da1ab21b1458a80e6
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_STARTER_TIME <ICE_STARTER_TIME>` controls the maximum amount of "
"time the starter will run in each start attempt."
msgstr ":ref:`ICE_STARTER_TIME <ICE_STARTER_TIME>` 控制每次启动尝试中启动器运行的最长时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:140 06dead5157784ae09e75d6943fbaacdc
#: 877fa93c42db4112af75cb19ce0a99c6
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_START_DELAY <ICE_START_DELAY>` sets a delay between start "
"attempts. This can be useful when your starter has a limited duty cycle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ICE_START_DELAY <ICE_START_DELAY>` 设置启动尝试之间的延迟。当启动器有有限的占空比时，这可能很有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:141 08e4fffbba2b4eb581ca5c8d8d1ca0e4
#: 91cec17f5e694d2e939c483ecdd39e86
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_RPM_THRESH <ICE_RPM_THRESH>` sets the minimum RPM reading for the "
"engine to be considered running. This should be set to a value below your "
"idle RPM."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ICE_RPM_THRESH <ICE_RPM_THRESH>` 设置发动机被视为运行的最低 RPM 读数。应将其设置为低于怠速 RPM "
"的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:142 01568e895a8a4be38c8d951f7740e495
#: 9ef0e03d829b403e85cd13eb2f4deb6a
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_STRT_MX_RTRY<ICE_STRT_MX_RTRY>` if set to a value greater than 0 "
"then the engine will retry starting the engine this many times before giving"
" up."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ICE_STRT_MX_RTRY<ICE_STRT_MX_RTRY>` 如果设置为大于 0 的值，则发动机在放弃之前将重试启动此次数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:146 158fe1e290c6460184d5855574e9c397
#: dfc5f2ba7461431b9bf7aa0006ef4198
msgid "Starting without an Onboard Starter"
msgstr "不使用板载启动器启动"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:147 50022b0ae0454d48b5faec7b419f53e4
#: bfff551a7ff84dc0a4f406e367d86e76
msgid ""
"If using a hand-held starter motor to start the engine, set "
":ref:`ICE_STARTER_TIME <ICE_STARTER_TIME>` to a relatively high value (at "
"least 10 seconds). This will give you time between hitting the switch and "
"starting the engine with the hand-held starter. After this time period has "
"elapsed, the throttle will drop from :ref:`ICE_START_PCT <ICE_START_PCT>` to"
" :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT <ICE_IDLE_PCT>` regardless of whether the engine has "
"started or not. *After* this point, if you are using an optional RPM sensor,"
" the engine start logic may begin again if the engine has not started, or if"
" it stalls after starting and the RPM drops below the :ref:`ICE_RPM_THRESH "
"<ICE_RPM_THRESH>`. Because of this, it is not recommended to set a short "
"time period for the starter cycle, since it will periodically dip the "
"throttle as you are trying to start the engine, which might make it harder "
"to start."
msgstr ""
"如果使用手持启动器电机来启动发动机，将 :ref:`ICE_STARTER_TIME <ICE_STARTER_TIME>` 设置为相对较高的值（至少 "
"10 秒）。这将给你一定时间在按下开关和用手持启动器启动发动机之间操作。此时间段过后，无论发动机是否启动，油门都将从 "
":ref:`ICE_START_PCT <ICE_START_PCT>` 降至 :ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT "
"<ICE_IDLE_PCT>`。此后，如果你使用可选的 RPM 传感器，如果发动机未能启动，或在启动后熄火且 RPM 降至 "
":ref:`ICE_RPM_THRESH <ICE_RPM_THRESH>` "
"以下，发动机启动逻辑可能重新开始。因此，不建议为启动器循环设置较短的时间段，因为它会在你尝试启动发动机时定期降低油门，这可能会使启动变得更加困难。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:149 ab2a53bc73de43f993a74dc1abed90d3
#: deba559ef584470e9d8d4e89c3b806c8
msgid ""
"If the engine stalls after startup, toggle the engine control off and on, "
"then try to start again."
msgstr "如果发动机在启动后熄火，关闭并重新打开发动机控制，然后再次尝试启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:152 c698a79c567e4bc2aec79c4108a16cf4
#: e5c7a50569284181ad8048b4e0cf086c
msgid "RPM Configuration"
msgstr "RPM 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:153 90ed6e745a7f46a3bbcde11b9f829f44
#: 9ef208388cda45c3988507405ee1bd62
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports generic pulse tachometers connected to GPIO pins (such as"
" the Aux servo pins on a PixHawk or Cube). A tachometer may be made using a "
"simple hall effect switch IC. Some ignition modules support a tachometer "
"output that can be connected directly to the GPIO pins. Desert Aircraft "
"Electronic Ignition V2 modules support tachometer output on the signal pin "
"of the power input connector. Note that when connecting an RPM sensor to an "
"AUX pin, it is important to make sure that this pin is not configured to "
"output a PWM value and, instead, be a GPIO pin. See :ref:`common-gpios` and "
":ref:`common-rpm` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持连接到 GPIO 引脚（如 Pixhawk 或 Cube 上的辅助舵机引脚）的通用脉冲转速计。可以使用简单的霍尔效应开关 IC "
"制作转速计。某些点火模块支持可以直接连接到 GPIO 引脚的转速计输出。Desert Aircraft 电子点火 V2 "
"模块支持在电源输入连接器的信号引脚上的转速计输出。请注意，将 RPM 传感器连接到 AUX 引脚时，确保该引脚未配置为输出 PWM 值，而是配置为 "
"GPIO 引脚，这一点很重要。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-gpios` 和 :ref:`common-rpm`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:155 925f751eba8c4d26a1b232bd1a2d1575
#: bdc07a66b5ad43c394dbe2a14157814a
msgid ""
"Alternatively, many electronic fuel injection (EFI) systems transmit engine "
"RPM via their own telemetry system. If you have configured an EFI system, "
"and it supports RPM telemetry, then ArduPilot can use this RPM value "
"directly without needing a separate RPM sensor. See :ref:`Electronic Fuel "
"Injection <common-efi>`."
msgstr ""
"另外，许多电子燃油喷射（EFI）系统通过其自己的数传系统传输发动机 RPM。如果你配置了 EFI 系统，且它支持 RPM 数传，ArduPilot "
"可以直接使用此 RPM 值，无需单独的 RPM 传感器。见 :ref:`电子燃油喷射 <common-efi>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:157 7d7c3d6487f84aa38effe70346b9f462
#: ec17a49d9425477a81caab2391d074b7
msgid ""
"In order to configure an RPM sensor, the following parameters must be set:"
msgstr "要配置 RPM 传感器，必须设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:159 98f50786e7b24775979a7e0f1f915c7a
#: e50a3332a7644d8797c8a4743509606f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RPM1_TYPE <RPM1_TYPE>` for whichever RPM source you are using."
msgstr "根据你使用的 RPM 来源设置 :ref:`RPM1_TYPE <RPM1_TYPE>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:160 351c68046e79453983b8d3f43fbaceb4
#: 57c7e712ca1945b7bdc2514e467d8ce2
msgid "Set the remaining 'RPM_*' parameters as appropriate for your system."
msgstr "根据系统情况设置其余的 「RPM_*」参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:161 be29e9612edd4518b93060b1eae16be9
#: e42d4f46c4d14e43865f9e0d25ced791
msgid "Set :ref:`ICE_RPM_CHAN <ICE_RPM_CHAN>` to 1."
msgstr "设置 :ref:`ICE_RPM_CHAN <ICE_RPM_CHAN>` 为 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:164 864f81f0062f44d3945ff670aa37da76
#: f01eb7ee750d4867b9cfdfbab53dabfa
msgid "Idle and redline governors"
msgstr "怠速和超速调速器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:166 53fb96b5ad434458acca80e7c0d7c224
#: 87e5ffcc09c4440a9bd01b935959f95e
msgid ""
"These features rely on having a source for engine RPM. See `RPM "
"Configuration`_ above for more information."
msgstr "这些功能依赖于发动机 RPM 来源。更多信息请参阅上方「RPM 配置」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:168 567097f6077740eebe64421f5b788274
#: d27a6c22ce954ffd96bcc838dc7453fe
msgid ""
"The idle governor allows the autopilot to adjust the throttle to maintain an"
" RPM value when the commanded throttle is low. This can be useful when the "
"engine is waiting for takeoff and reduces the workload on the pilot during "
"that time. Increasing the throttle command will give the expected throttle "
"response."
msgstr ""
"怠速调速器允许飞控在命令油门较低时调整油门以维持 RPM 值。这在发动机等待起飞时很有用，可以减少该时段飞手的工作量。增加油门命令将产生预期的油门响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:170 b92948ad727644a2bdbd1a430d081b42
#: e855fd8b420d4dce8ab484d672edd982
msgid ""
"Prior to ArduPilot 4.7, while the aircraft is disarmed, the idle governor "
"only works in Manual mode (and only if :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 2"
" is set). If your engine cannot run reliably without the idle governor, you "
"will need to arm in Manual mode before switching to another mode to take "
"off. Once armed, the idle governor will work in all modes."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 4.7 之前，当飞行器解锁状态下，怠速调速器仅在手动模式下工作（仅当设置了 "
":ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 2 "
"位时）。如果发动机没有怠速调速器无法可靠运行，你需要在手动模式下解锁，然后切换到另一种模式起飞。解锁后，怠速调速器将在所有模式下工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:172 eac8f1e68c7c4a9c923422fcd448cefe
#: ec3230e9fd7e4c9e886126269def407c
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` This is the minimum percentage throttle "
"output while running, this includes being disarmed, but not while outputs "
"are disabled by the safety switch."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ICE_IDLE_PCT<ICE_IDLE_PCT>` 这是运行时的最小油门输出百分比，包括解锁状态，但不包括被安全开关禁用输出时。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:173 b067e1a066ba42b889e3ba1e8db8b28d
#: cfa9f61d42d34fe5a4118f02863d4251
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_IDLE_RPM<ICE_IDLE_RPM>` This configures the RPM that will be "
"commanded by the idle governor. Set to -1 to disable."
msgstr ":ref:`ICE_IDLE_RPM<ICE_IDLE_RPM>` 这配置怠速调速器将命令的 RPM。设置为 -1 以禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:174 6fa821f0d8274073844051184b04c35c
#: befe74a247ba4cd7bc508dcf389f56c2
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_IDLE_DB<ICE_IDLE_DB>` This configures the RPM deadband that is "
"tolerated before adjusting the idle setpoint."
msgstr ":ref:`ICE_IDLE_DB<ICE_IDLE_DB>` 这配置在调整怠速设定点之前允许的 RPM 死区。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:175 5f4de85560654021942b2af1de3c98cb
#: ce61e69771474586980b321ece66cc06
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_IDLE_SLEW<ICE_IDLE_SLEW>` This configures the slewrate used to "
"adjust the idle setpoint in percentage points per second."
msgstr ":ref:`ICE_IDLE_SLEW<ICE_IDLE_SLEW>` 这配置用于调整怠速设定点的变化率（百分点/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:177 95f68b8fe40f40509145a1d37fee9e1e
#: bd01555f9ee844fc9c30e8cc7b21f13e
msgid ""
"The redline governor will slowly reduce the throttle if the RPM remains "
"above the given RPM value. Generally, this RPM value is provided by the "
"manufacturer of the engine. If the commanded throttle drops faster or lower "
"than the point the governor started, then the governor will be released and "
"normal control of the throttle will return to normal throttle response. A "
"warning message will appear on the GCS. Setting "
":ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 1 allows disabling the throttle actions "
"of the redline governor, but still displays the GCS warning message."
msgstr ""
"超速调速器在 RPM 持续高于给定 RPM 值时会缓慢降低油门。通常，此 RPM "
"值由发动机制造商提供。如果命令油门下降得比调速器开始介入的点更快或更低，则调速器将释放，油门控制将恢复正常油门响应。地面站将显示警告消息。设置 "
":ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 1 位允许禁用超速调速器的油门操作，但仍显示地面站警告消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:179 20e21cd1d5a942d4b9346bd5ca1c2fae
#: bfccd970e1a5416d8c6ba18df9c45092
msgid ""
":ref:`ICE_REDLINE_RPM<ICE_REDLINE_RPM>` Maximum RPM for the engine provided "
"by the manufacturer. A value of 0 disables this feature."
msgstr ":ref:`ICE_REDLINE_RPM<ICE_REDLINE_RPM>` 制造商提供的发动机最大 RPM。值为 0 时禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:182 517dc71551214fd48c70805ad934a4c9
#: 590195c784e049988bdda5796c4cae33
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:184 0968d42cf7b24d49bed5559a4ab16a3b
