msgstr "在支持此功能的启动器上反转发动机曲轴方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:197 33cb02cc1e16458d8ff183d783a09dc5
#: a73c98f5abb041dd99a3898a57e874f5
msgid "Vibration isolation"
msgstr "减震"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:199 9df47605844a40f28bcd0cf4699ac18e
#: ff65748ffb054b9db4ee936c7154366e
msgid ""
"The high vibration from internal combustion engines means that "
":ref:`vibration dampening <common-vibration-damping>` is critical.  It is "
"often necessary to mount the autopilot on a plate with `self-adhesive lead "
"weights <https://www.amazon.com/Great-Planes-Segmented-"
"Weights-6-Ounce/dp/B0015KLJE0>`__ added to increase its mass."
msgstr ""
"内燃机产生的高震动意味着 :ref:`减震 <common-vibration-damping>` 至关重要。通常需要将飞控安装在加有 `自粘铅块 "
"<https://www.amazon.com/Great-Planes-Segmented-"
"Weights-6-Ounce/dp/B0015KLJE0>`__ 的板上以增加其质量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:203 1b5d1e1c220940d9b926cf4a8379ff8f
#: 43e723d2dd5e438f831a0d286608badd
msgid ""
"When using Internal Combustion Engine (ICE) motors, vibration during engine "
"run-up can cause the IMU consistency checks to fail, preventing arming. In "
"ArduPilot 4.7 and later an option has been added to "
":ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>`: bit 2 (Skip IMU consistency checks "
"when ICE motor running)"
msgstr ""
"使用内燃机（ICE）电机时，发动机热机时的震动可能导致 IMU 一致性检查失败，从而阻止解锁。在 ArduPilot 4.7 "
"及更高版本中，:ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 中添加了一个选项：第 2 位（ICE 电机运行时跳过 IMU "
"一致性检查）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ice.rst:208 588ef616043a4cc599dac06e09f9042e
#: bbdacd3f74b74ece96bacb8e972fcbd1
msgid ""
"When this bit is set (value +4), ArduPilot will bypass the IMU consistency "
"check if an ICE motor is running. This is intended for setups where ICE "
"engines are typically started before arming, and their vibration may "
"otherwise trigger false failures."
msgstr ""
"当设置此位（值 +4）时，如果 ICE 电机正在运行，ArduPilot 将绕过 IMU 一致性检查。这适用于 ICE "
"发动机通常在解锁前启动的情况，其震动否则可能触发误报故障。"
